# Risk Tier Constraints

You are editing a **high-risk path**. See [docs/agent-governance/risk-tiers.md](../../docs/agent-governance/risk-tiers.md).

## Required behavior

- Make minimal, focused changes only
- Do NOT delete files or restructure without explicit human approval
- Explain every change in the PR description
- Run `pnpm harness:validate` after edits

## T0 paths (human approval required)

- `.github/workflows/`, `CODEOWNERS`, `CONSTITUTION.md`
- Auth and secret-related files

If unsure, **stop and ask the human**.
